# Compass — mandatory stack (always enforce)

Next.js 16 · React 19 · Tailwind CSS v4 · shadcn/ui · Radix UI · lucide-react · Zustand

DO NOT reinvent UI primitives. Before new components:
1. Reuse src/shared/components/ui/
2. Add via: npx shadcn@latest add <component>
3. Use Radix-backed shadcn for Dialog, Dropdown, Tabs, Popover, Select, etc.

Never hand-roll modals, menus, or accessible controls. Use cn() from @/lib/utils.

Details: .cursor/rules/tech-stack.mdc and AGENTS.md
